"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[76130],{76130:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<BookCard \\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/books/the-therapist.png\\"\\n          title=\\"The Therapist\\"\\n          author=\\"B. A. Paris\\"\\n          publisher=\\"Momo\\"\\n          publishedDate=\\"2021-12-06\\"\\n          isbn=\\"9791191043518\\"\\n          rating=3.5\\n          tags=\\"thriller\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nThe foreshadowing was well laid out for the twist.  \\nThe protagonist distrusts and suspects everyone regarding a past incident.  \\n<br>\\nIndeed, a person who knows a lot attracts a lot of suspicion and jealousy. Being a ```psychological counselor``` is clearly not an easy job.  \\n<br>\\nThe setting where the protagonist solves a case that the police missed in the past by herself is forced, but it seems unavoidable in this kind of novel. Let\'s just say the protagonist is smart.\\n"}')}}]);